{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.leu-kwsis-u-datos-di-ou-leukai-netai-oi-konomou-menon", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0433.1", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "V. xxx. — ΛΕΥΚΩΣΙΣ ΥΔΑΤΟΣ"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.leu-kwsis-u-datos-di-ou-leukai-netai-oi-konomou-menon", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0433.2", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ΔΙ' ΟΥ ΛΕΥΚΑΙΝΕΤΑΙ ΟΙΚΟΝΟΜΟΥΜΕΝΟΝ ΤΟ ΑΡΣΕΝΙΚΟΝ"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.leu-kwsis-u-datos-di-ou-leukai-netai-oi-konomou-menon", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0433.3", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ΚΑΙ ΣΑΝΔΑΡΑΧΗ"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.leu-kwsis-u-datos-di-ou-leukai-netai-oi-konomou-menon", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0433.4", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Ὅτε συνενεῦται ὁ χαλχὸς ὀπτούμενος στυπτηρίας σχιστῆς μέρος α',"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.leu-kwsis-u-datos-di-ou-leukai-netai-oi-konomou-menon", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0433.5", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "χόμμεως λευκοῦ μέρος α', λύει σὺν τῷ χόμψει ὕδωρ, καὶ ὅταν λύει,"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.leu-kwsis-u-datos-di-ou-leukai-netai-oi-konomou-menon", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0433.6", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "γίνεται γλοιοῦ πάχος. Βάλε τὴν στυπτηρίαν ἀπὸ σκεῦος, καὶ κατᾶγε"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.leu-kwsis-u-datos-di-ou-leukai-netai-oi-konomou-menon", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0433.7", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "τὸ ὕδωρ τοῦ χόμμεως ἕπτα ἕως οὐ ἀναξηρανθῇ, καὶ ἔχε. Τοῦτο"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.leu-kwsis-u-datos-di-ou-leukai-netai-oi-konomou-menon", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0433.8", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "συνλείουται τὸ ἄρσενίχην, καὶ ἡ σανδαράχη, καὶ χαλχός, καὶ τότε εἰς"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.leu-kwsis-u-datos-di-ou-leukai-netai-oi-konomou-menon", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0433.9", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "τὴν ὀπτησιν ἄγει."}
